You unleash the glorious vision of the past when the continent was filled with death and plagues.

All foes in range [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] catch a dire plague for 5 turns, dealing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage each turn.

The Dire Plague is considered a disease but is not prevented by disease immunity.

Every turn there is a [2%, 3%, 4%, 6%, 7% (TL1-5)] chance of a piece of the soul to be ripped away, increasing your souls by 1.
